#: desc: Without arguments the help is printed (the awk args line below is intentionally empty)

#: stdout
Usage: awk [-v option=value] -f makefile-doc.awk [Makefile ...]
Description: Generate docs for Makefile variables and targets
Version: @VERSION@
Options:
  OUTPUT_FORMAT: ANSI
  EXPORT_THEME (theme for HTML/LATEX output):
  SUB (substitutions):
  DSUB (substitutions in docs and names):
  VARS ([bool] show documented variables): 1
  PADDING (a padding character between anchors and docs): " "
  DEPRECATED ([bool] show deprecated anchors): 1
  OFFSET (offset of docs from anchors): 2
  COLOR ([bool] use colors): 1
  RECIPEPREFIX: |	|
  COLOR_DEFAULT: 34
  COLOR_ATTENTION: 31
  COLOR_DEPRECATED: 33
  COLOR_SECTION: 32
  COLOR_BACKTICKS: 0
#: exit: 1
